## Looping & iteration

Loops with `for` can have zero, one, or three parts:
- infinite loop: `for { ... }`
- "while" loop: `for <condition> { ... }`
- traditional loop: `for <init>; <condition>; <post> { ... }`
- `break` and `continue` work as expected

